  "fullContentHtml": "<h2>AIIMS CRE 5th Group B & C Re-Exam Result 2026 – Full Details</h2>\n<p>All India Institute of Medical Sciences (AIIMS), New Delhi, has released the Re-Exam Result for the various Common Recruitment Examination (CRE) Group-B and Group-C Posts. This recruitment was released for 1485 posts. Applications for the AIIMS CRE Group B, C Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 13 June 2026, to 03 July 2026. The Re-Exam is going to be conducted on 31 August & 01 September 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can can download their AIIMS CRE 5th Group B & C Re-Exam Result 2026 from the link given below.</p>\n<h2>Important Dates</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Application Start Date :</strong> 13 June 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Last Date :</strong> 03 July 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Fee Payment Last Date :</strong> 03 July 2026</li>\n<li><strong>NOC Submit Form :</strong> 08 July 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Application Status Available :</strong> 11 July 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Exam Date :</strong> 25-27 July 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Admit Card :</strong> August 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Result Declared Date :</strong> 11 August 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Re-Exam Date :</strong> 31 August & 01 September 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Re-Exam City Details :</strong> 24 August 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Re-Exam Result :</strong> 29 August 2026</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Application Fee</h2><ul>\n<li>General, OBC : Rs. 3000/-</li>\n<li>SC, ST, EWS : Rs. 2400/-</li>\n<li>For PwD : 0/-</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>How to Check Result</h2><ol>\n<li>Click on the direct official result link provided below.</li>\n<li>Enter your Roll Number / Registration Number and Date of Birth.</li>\n<li>Submit the form to view your scorecard on screen.</li>\n<li>Download and print a copy of the result for future reference.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Important Links</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://aiimsexams.ac.in/result/6a2cdd89be81945a8330d450\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Check Re-Exam Result</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aiimsexams.ac.in/auth/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Re-Exam Admit Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://rrpdocuments.aiimsexams.ac.in/1786098641903-816454103.pdf?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=AKIAVRUVRLXWMSLVSAP7%2F20260807%2Fap-south-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260807T105836Z&X-Amz-Expires=604800&X-Amz-Signature=aec219c4ce2d764f182ffcc2793fe3ba50a6a47d8c7c388cfaa89373a86120ad&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&response-content-type=application%2Fpdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Check Re-Exam Date Notice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://rrpdocuments.aiimsexams.ac.in/1786452302175-397653319.pdf?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=AKIAVRUVRLXWMSLVSAP7%2F20260811%2Fap-south-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260811T134911Z&X-Amz-Expires=604800&X-Amz-Signature=eabdc1d612adc39a95b596aa8f020354752faa8957cb39fe21523c92bcfeb25a&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&response-content-type=application%2Fpdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Result</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://rrpdocuments.aiimsexams.ac.in/1785490460691-637744709.pdf?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=AKIAVRUVRLXWMSLVSAP7%2F20260731%2Fap-south-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260731T100412Z&X-Amz-Expires=18000&X-Amz-Signature=6a540b449f1f0f4ac5d7f9035390ae434ab83aacce3fa5c6f93aa6bc816cfe8a&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&response-content-type=application%2Fpdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Check Re-Exam Notice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aiimsexams.ac.in/advertisement/6a2cdd89be81945a8330d450\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Admit Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://rrpdocuments.aiimsexams.ac.in/1784265336757-399501708.pdf?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=AKIAVRUVRLXWMSLVSAP7%2F20260717%2Fap-south-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260717T054759Z&X-Amz-Expires=18000&X-Amz-Signature=fd20df46ebaa470fad71d069a5279ebc4d3d75a73d53034ed4539f